Shattering up to [1, 1, 2, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] ghouls or ghasts you create a putrescent swirling cloud of radius [3, 4, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)] that follows you around for 3 turns per dead ghoul plus one turn. Oldest ghouls are prioritized for destruction.

Any ghoul or ghast dying or expiring within this cloud increases its duration by [1, 1, 1, 1, 2 (TL1-5)] turn and every two absorbed ghoul/ghast your gain back one soul.

The cloud deals [50, 67, 80, 92, 102 (TL1-5; SP 100)] frostdusk damage to any foes caught inside.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
